Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:50:33 -0700
Subject: [v2 only] bench: prepare native V7 corpus and compression-control
 receipts

Use the actual J3 MiniWallet and native miner for commitments, state roots, headers and proof of work. Fund confirmed fanout outputs, create real V7 spends with explicit native burn-output padding, and derive the relay block on a disposable clone. Refuse legacy or incomplete native fixtures. Record encoder policy, actual cache counters, application/wire byte totals and binary identities for same-source comparisons. Corpus consensus generation and final timing remain gated on the corrected integrated source.
